      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 FLUX.1 Dev \u2014 Text to Image",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 FLUX.1 Dev \u2014 Text to Image\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 UNETLoader\n**Model:** `flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n> ~12 GB fp8 \u2014 best open-source T2I\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 DualCLIPLoader\n**Model:** `clip_l.safetensors + t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 VAELoader\n**Model:** `ae.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- None \u2014 all core nodes\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- cfg=1, 20 steps, euler+simple is the recommended baseline\n- Pre-installed LoRAs in loras/Flux/: Realism, Add Details, AntiBlur, Turbo Alpha, Hyper-SD\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "color": "#231535",
      "bgcolor": "#3f2460"
    },
